 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jakie korzyści daje stosowanie serum z biofermentami?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-t9ifiep6wo" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Stosowanie serum z biofermentami przynosi ulgę wrażliwej i zestresowanej skórze, zwiększa syntezę kwasu hialuronowego, wspomaga redukcję niedoskonałości oraz zabezpiecza skórę przed nadmierną utratą wody.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-u9887ejbef8" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-u9887ejbef8"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak prawidłowo stosować serum z biofermentami?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-m4pha8oirds" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Niewielką ilość serum nałóż na oczyszczoną skórę twarzy, szyi i dekoltu. Serum można stosować na dzień (także pod makijaż) oraz na noc.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-ttzcotpmoi" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-ttzcotpmoi"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z biofermentami jest odpowiednie dla każdego typu skóry?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-dll0h2omppg" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Serum jest szczególnie polecane dla cery suchej lub podrażnionej kuracjami kosmetycznymi, ale może być stosowane przez osoby o różnych typach skóry.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-qbezduimf3" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-qbezduimf3"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak często można stosować serum z biofermentami?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="4"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-4ki9frqto47" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Serum można stosować codziennie, rano i wieczorem, w zależności od indywidualnych potrzeb skóry.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-t7bpi9il7pk" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-t7bpi9il7pk"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z biofermentami można stosować pod makijaż?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="5"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-iggdt04jbf9" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Tak, serum z biofermentami można stosować pod makijaż, ponieważ dobrze się wchłania i nie pozostawia tłustej warstwy.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy serum z biofermentami można stosować w ciąży?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="6"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-mbbvaq4jrjf" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Stosowanie serum z biofermentami w ciąży jest zazwyczaj bezpieczne, jednak przed rozpoczęciem jakiejkolwiek nowej kuracji kosmetycznej w czasie ciąży, warto skonsultować się z lekarzem.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section>
